# QNX Photon shelf, down either screen edge -- there is no taskbar row
# below it any more.  It is one program -- bin/shelf-panel -- which owns its
# own width, its own section layout and its own collapse state, so none of
# that lives here any more.  What fvwm still needs to know is how much edge
# it is claiming, and that is read back from the panel where EwmhBaseStruts
# is set below.

# FvwmPager width/height. Keep both divisible by DesktopSize so the generated
# background tile lines up with the page cells (3x3 -> 128x72 per page).
InfoStoreAdd pager_width 384
InfoStoreAdd pager_height 216
# How long the pager stays raised after a page change
InfoStoreAdd pager_flash_ms 100

InfoStoreAdd belowbottomlayer 1
InfoStoreAdd bottomlayer 2
InfoStoreAdd putlayer 4
InfoStoreAdd toplayer 6
InfoStoreAdd abovetoplayer 11
DefaultLayers $[infostore.bottomlayer] $[infostore.putlayer] $[infostore.toplayer]

